  "bodyTypst": "Let $f$ be the function given by $f(x)= 2 x e^(2 x)$.\n\n(a) Find $lim_(x -> - oo) f(x)$ and $lim_(x -> oo) f(x)$.\n\n(b) Find the absolute minimum value of $f$. Justify that your answer is an absolute minimum.\n\n(c) What is the range of $f$ ?\n\n(d) Consider the family of functions defined by $y = b x e^(b x)$, where $b$ is a nonzero constant. Show that the absolute minimum value of $b x e^(b x)$ is the same for all nonzero values of $b$.",
